  "description": "T-4137: the captions and labels a pivot definition controls, each sheet one builder-v2 pivot Excel renders on open. K1: rowHeaderCaption, colHeaderCaption, grandTotalCaption and dataCaption on a compact pivot with two data fields. K2: missingCaption with showMissing over an empty intersection (West/C). K3: errorCaption with showError over a sum holding #DIV/0!. K4: page fields showing (All), one selected item, and several selected items. K5: custom subtotal functions (sum and count) on the outer row field of a tabular pivot. K6: a tabular pivot whose two data fields both come from non-compact fields (Sales, Units), the Row Labels question pivots.md leaves open. Aggregate default names (`Count of`...) are written by the file, not chosen by Excel, so they are not probed here. Pivot cells are in the sidecar's `pivots` section; Q!A1 makes the case scored.",
  "tags": ["probe", "pivot", "T-4137", "M16"],
